WEBVTT

00:00:12.795 --> 00:00:14.658
[chuckles] Oh.

00:00:14.762 --> 00:00:17.362
[engine racing]

00:00:17.467 --> 00:00:20.032
[sirens wailing]

00:00:24.774 --> 00:00:26.014
They're still on us.

00:00:27.094 --> 00:00:28.113
This'll slow 'em down.
[grunts]

00:00:28.222 --> 00:00:29.613
[tires screeching]

00:00:41.647 --> 00:00:43.513
["It's Tricky" playing]

00:00:43.623 --> 00:00:46.724
♪ This speech is my recital
I think it's very vital♪

00:00:46.819 --> 00:00:48.286
♪ To rock a rhyme
That's right on time♪

00:00:48.382 --> 00:00:50.295
♪ "It's Tricky" is the title
Here we go♪

00:00:50.391 --> 00:00:52.592
♪ It's tricky to rock a rhyme
To rock a rhyme♪

00:00:52.687 --> 00:00:54.026
♪ That's right on time
It's tricky♪

00:00:54.123 --> 00:00:57.023
Watch out. Excuse me.
Pardon me. Coming through.

00:00:57.131 --> 00:00:58.774
[song continues playing]

00:00:58.883 --> 00:01:00.844
Good evening, gentlemen.
Mind if I drive?

00:01:00.932 --> 00:01:02.936
[tires squealing]
[screaming]

00:01:03.024 --> 00:01:04.224
Better buckle up.

00:01:05.715 --> 00:01:07.862
[robbers screaming]

00:01:12.081 --> 00:01:14.264
How we doing back there?

00:01:15.064 --> 00:01:16.244
And now this way.

00:01:16.244 --> 00:01:17.234
[grunting]

00:01:17.234 --> 00:01:18.445
[Sonic laughing]

00:01:18.913 --> 00:01:20.702
Whoo-hoo!

00:01:21.087 --> 00:01:23.261
[muffled shouting]

00:01:23.344 --> 00:01:28.144
Oh, I'm sorry.
I don't speak duct tape.

00:01:28.245 --> 00:01:29.263
[grunts]

00:01:29.365 --> 00:01:31.571
What the heck are you?
Fear not, citizen.

00:01:31.672 --> 00:01:35.609
I am the hero you need
and the hero you deserve.

00:01:35.711 --> 00:01:38.221
The blue dawn
that banishes the darkest--

00:01:38.324 --> 00:01:39.324
Holy crap!

00:01:39.449 --> 00:01:40.588
[both screaming]

00:01:40.716 --> 00:01:43.247
[tires squealing]

00:01:43.374 --> 00:01:44.374
[screaming]
Don't worry.

00:01:44.534 --> 00:01:45.854
Nobody's gonna get hurt.

00:01:50.974 --> 00:01:52.954
Huh.
What are those?
Bombs. Bombs.

00:01:52.954 --> 00:01:54.574
They're bombs!
Those are bombs!

00:01:54.933 --> 00:01:56.553
Relax.
They're not even lit.

00:01:56.853 --> 00:01:59.574
So I'll say again,
nobody's gonna get--

00:02:00.774 --> 00:02:03.214
[screams] I was wrong!
We're all gonna die!
[whimpering]

00:02:05.574 --> 00:02:07.194
Why aren't you slowing down?

00:02:07.574 --> 00:02:08.934
That would require brakes.

00:02:11.123 --> 00:02:14.163
Oh, it's hot.
Hot, hot, hot!

00:02:14.203 --> 00:02:15.603
Why don't you just let
the police handle this?

00:02:15.863 --> 00:02:18.763
Because that's not
what heroes do.

00:02:21.373 --> 00:02:24.273
Thank you very much.
Please hold your applause.

00:02:25.435 --> 00:02:26.929
[horns honking]

00:02:27.029 --> 00:02:28.224
[fuse sizzling]

00:02:28.324 --> 00:02:31.344
Do you hear that?
There's one bomb left.

00:02:32.003 --> 00:02:33.164
Uh... Uh-oh.

00:02:33.764 --> 00:02:35.104
Did you check
under the seat?

00:02:35.444 --> 00:02:36.784
Of course I checked
under the seat!

00:02:37.269 --> 00:02:38.407
[horn honking]

00:02:38.524 --> 00:02:40.444
You are terrible at this!

00:02:40.584 --> 00:02:43.344
You know what?
Your negative attitude
is not helping anyone.

00:02:44.064 --> 00:02:45.283
It's in your spiky things!

00:02:46.883 --> 00:02:48.824
Ha! I can never
find anything in here.
[grunts]

00:02:50.743 --> 00:02:52.243
Drained it from downtown!
[mimics fanfare]

00:02:53.944 --> 00:02:56.383
See? I told you
nobody would get hurt.

00:02:57.162 --> 00:02:59.648
[people chattering]

00:02:59.794 --> 00:03:01.014
Holy sherbet!

00:03:03.104 --> 00:03:04.104
Oh, hello.

00:03:04.683 --> 00:03:07.224
Don't panic.
This is only a drill.

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:10.927
[drill whirring]

00:03:11.031 --> 00:03:12.347
[people exclaiming]

00:03:17.746 --> 00:03:21.553
[guard screaming]

00:03:23.075 --> 00:03:25.429
[breathing shakily]

00:03:32.109 --> 00:03:33.286
[fuse sizzling]

00:03:35.294 --> 00:03:36.436
[gasps]

00:03:46.369 --> 00:03:48.757
[sirens wailing]
[tires screech]

00:03:49.380 --> 00:03:50.419
Come here!

00:03:50.523 --> 00:03:52.803
No need to thank me, citizens.

00:03:53.423 --> 00:03:56.364
All in a night's work for...

00:03:56.364 --> 00:03:57.803
Blue Justice!

00:03:59.164 --> 00:04:00.444
You're a terrible hero!

00:04:00.551 --> 00:04:03.178
[Sonic laughing]

00:04:03.286 --> 00:04:04.545
["Stars In The Sky" playing]

00:04:04.652 --> 00:04:07.064
♪ The feelings running deep♪

00:04:07.171 --> 00:04:09.114
♪ Ain't no time for sleep♪

00:04:09.222 --> 00:04:12.748
♪ A second to unwind
Head up in the sky♪

00:04:12.856 --> 00:04:13.935
[Sonic] Morning, Wade!

00:04:14.043 --> 00:04:15.043
Morning, Sonic!

00:04:15.147 --> 00:04:19.029
[song continues playing]

00:04:19.965 --> 00:04:22.703
[Sonic] Whoo-hoo-hoo-hoo-hoo!

00:04:22.808 --> 00:04:25.754
Good morning, Green Hills!

00:04:34.765 --> 00:04:35.765
[grunting]

00:04:35.806 --> 00:04:37.886
Ah! Oop! Oh.

00:04:37.989 --> 00:04:40.034
[sighs]

00:04:40.138 --> 00:04:43.570
[floor creaking]
[groaning]

00:04:43.674 --> 00:04:45.174
[floor creaks louder]
Oh, come on.

00:04:47.194 --> 00:04:48.194
Uh-oh. Uh...

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:56.202
[gasps]

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:06.569
[inaudible]

00:05:06.673 --> 00:05:08.268
Oh, Sonic.

00:05:08.374 --> 00:05:11.173
I miss you, Longclaw.

00:05:11.874 --> 00:05:13.574
I'm trying
to make you proud.

00:05:23.314 --> 00:05:26.853
[yawning] And now
for a little shut-eye.

00:05:28.387 --> 00:05:29.510
[lapping]

00:05:29.624 --> 00:05:30.624
Oh! Blech!

00:05:31.224 --> 00:05:32.864
Ozzy, morning breath!

00:05:32.923 --> 00:05:34.683
Sonic.
Are you still in bed?

00:05:35.464 --> 00:05:37.084
You're supposed
to meet Tom, remember?

00:05:37.226 --> 00:05:39.081
[grunts]

00:05:39.224 --> 00:05:42.704
All right, all right,
I'm up! I'm up.

00:05:44.524 --> 00:05:45.524
[Tom sighs]
What a day.

00:05:45.799 --> 00:05:48.258
Whoo!

00:05:48.394 --> 00:05:49.634
Thanks for coming out, bud.

00:05:50.874 --> 00:05:51.914
You know,
I feel like you and me,

00:05:51.974 --> 00:05:53.474
we haven't had
much time together lately.

00:05:56.514 --> 00:05:57.834
How's it going over there?
You getting any bites?

00:05:57.959 --> 00:06:00.904
[snoring]

00:06:06.174 --> 00:06:07.914
[screams]
I can't swim! Help!

00:06:08.134 --> 00:06:09.854
If I die,
don't look in my closet!

00:06:10.414 --> 00:06:11.614
Hey, hey, you're good.
You're all right. Come on.

00:06:11.740 --> 00:06:13.348
[shivering]
It's freezing.

00:06:13.476 --> 00:06:16.271
All right, okay.
Take it easy.

00:06:16.397 --> 00:06:18.007
[shivering]

00:06:18.134 --> 00:06:19.894
All right.
You're good. Okay.

00:06:24.394 --> 00:06:26.494
But now that you've had
a nap and a bath...

00:06:26.994 --> 00:06:31.594
I went up to your room
last night to bring you
some new comics and, um...

00:06:35.324 --> 00:06:36.984
[Sonic on tape]
Whoa, whoa, whoa.
Stop right there.

00:06:37.144 --> 00:06:38.204
I wouldn't come any closer,

00:06:38.204 --> 00:06:41.384
because this little hedgehog
had way too many chili dogs.

00:06:41.524 --> 00:06:42.524
Oh, no. Oh, no.[farts]

00:06:43.243 --> 00:06:45.584
I'm so embarrassed.
Get out of here quick!

00:06:45.784 --> 00:06:47.064
Oh, no, here comes another one!
[farts]

00:06:48.204 --> 00:06:50.243
Go. Now. Save yourself.

00:06:50.244 --> 00:06:52.744
[tape rewinds] Whoa, whoa, whoa.
Stop right there.
I wouldn't come any closer,

00:06:52.744 --> 00:06:55.944
[distorting]
because this little hedgehog
had way too many chili dogs.

00:06:56.124 --> 00:06:57.124
Oh, no. Oh, no.
[farts]

00:06:57.844 --> 00:07:00.103
I'm so embarrassed.
Get out of here--

00:07:00.103 --> 00:07:01.924
Ugh! I knew I should've
used real farts.

00:07:04.824 --> 00:07:06.524
How many times
are we gonna do this?

00:07:06.644 --> 00:07:09.603
What? Cast your line
and not catch anything?
Seems like a billion.

00:07:09.603 --> 00:07:11.164
I think you know
what I'm talking about.

00:07:11.764 --> 00:07:14.364
The lying.
The sneaking out.

00:07:14.564 --> 00:07:15.804
The pretending
to be Batman.

00:07:16.103 --> 00:07:17.304
Blue Justice,
trademark pending.

00:07:17.383 --> 00:07:18.424
Whatever.
You're being reckless.

00:07:18.863 --> 00:07:21.123
Ugh!
Not this conversation again.

00:07:21.284 --> 00:07:22.984
Hey. It's no fun
for me, either.

00:07:23.044 --> 00:07:24.044
But if you keep
being irresponsible,

00:07:24.384 --> 00:07:25.524
we're gonna keep
having this conversation.

00:07:25.584 --> 00:07:28.064
How is it irresponsible
to use my powers?

00:07:28.123 --> 00:07:30.844
Sonic, you destroyed
an entire city block!

00:07:31.104 --> 00:07:32.724
That block
was already messed up.

00:07:32.744 --> 00:07:33.744
Who cares?

00:07:33.924 --> 00:07:37.304
Look, I stopped a robbery.
I was a hero.

00:07:37.704 --> 00:07:40.364
No, you put people
in danger and that's not
what a hero does.

